# kind  x y z (relative to the level center)  scale  yaw
# Default camera looks 45 deg down: decor must sit below the scene to be seen; the sun shows when the camera is lowered.
# Sea of clouds below the diorama
cloud_sea            0   -12     0   1.0    0
# Far layer: big shapes, small on screen
sun                -25    24   -45   2.5    0
cloud_big          -20    -3   -34   1.6   20
cloud_big           30    -1   -28   1.4  -30
floating_island     24    -2    20   1.3   30
# Mid layer
cloud_medium        13    -5   -15   1.0   10
cloud_medium       -15    -7    13   1.0   40
# Near layer: in front of a farther cloud on the same line of sight
cloud_small          7    -8    -8   1.0    0
cloud_small         -8  -8.5     7   1.0   60
bird                 0     5     0   1.0    0
